    "pull": "every lasting thing you have was entered at the one hour it could not be entered level, and it has held at that tilt ever since, by you, without complaint.",
    "tension": "she has tried to return something twice — a bad week of yours, an offer to come over — and both times it went strange in the room. the terms were set at the door and they run one way. what gets said about you is that you never ask for anything, which is heard as strength and is nearer to a clause. the two of you still meet in the positions you were in that night.",
