    "moon": "nothing in you takes that as temporary. what arrives at the doorway is the whole position, at its full weight, and nothing thins it when the actual one gets there at midnight — so you go on holding something that was handed back over your shoulder. everybody in the room adjusted to the real order within a minute. you are the last to know, and nobody tells you.",
