    "moon": "what The Drum puts down in a room does not sit there as a suggestion. it gets kept by people who could not tell you where they got it, and nothing in it fades. fourteen months later the mother answers the phone at the speed of somebody who just arrived, on a problem with years in it, and files her own exhaustion under a failure of stamina.",
