    "cost": "a household can be kept level by the one carrying the thing that would tip it, and nobody in it has spent a night wondering whether the place holds. nothing out of a structure is received as a confidence. what you hand over arrives as a change in the conditions, and the people who love you meet it with their hands out, steadying the room instead of hearing you."
