    "moon": "what comes back comes back whole, and that single fact is the generosity and the damage both. an appetite you had at twenty-two returns at twenty-two's strength into a life that has been settled for years. so does the grievance. everyone else's version of that summer has thirty years of wear on it. yours has none, because the one holding it was not out wearing it down.",
