    "moon": "which one of you a person gets is settled by what they came for. the patient one turns up for a certain kind of need and the quick one for another, and no choosing has ever taken place in here. so the several are distributed by appetite — an arrangement that suits everyone involved, was designed by nobody, and has been running for decades.",
