    "cost": "six people can be given six different things at once with no performance anywhere in it, because a different one of you means each of them. appetite decided which of them got used. the parts somebody wanted are the parts with hours on them, and whichever of you nobody was ever hungry for reaches sixty untested, unexercised, and as unfamiliar to you as to anyone."
