    "tension": "a partner gathers the evidence in the second year and puts it to you gently: nothing anybody says about you ever seems to land. she is right, and she has watched it happen for two years. each round goes into whoever answered the door and stops there. so you read as a person who cannot take a compliment, when five of the six have never had one and the sixth has a pile it cannot pass on.",
    "cost": "a name you did not build gets carried for decades without being put down, because the carrying is shared and no single one of you takes the whole weight of it. the doubt is not shared. it is issued whole to each of you, six times, and there is no evening on which more than one of you is available to hear the answer."
