    "moon": "showing less has never been available here, so all six have been out at one brightness, fully visible, and the visibility is exactly what prevents the count — six identical turns read as one animal that does not vary. what looks like an abundance sustained for thirty years is six people who have each been asked for a good evening and produced one.",
