    "tension": "generous is the word until two people compare their year. one had a whole weekend of you and one had a message, and the gap looks like a ranking that was made about them. no ranking was made. the evening each of them got was staffed by a different one of you, working from what that one had, and the display had already promised both of them the same amount.",
    "cost": "giving at that rate would empty a single person inside a decade, and nothing empties, because the turns rotate and the display never has to dim. heat is where it resolves. a hard enough year takes the spread off first, and what stands in the room afterwards is six people of ordinary size who have never been seen without it, and the room decides it watched you shrink."
