    "moon": "what was promised does not shed with the one who promised it. the terms stay in the house and get kept by whoever is out — same voice, same days, same warmth — so the far end receives an unbroken performance of an arrangement one of its two parties has already left. no one is faking. whoever is keeping it means every word.",
