    "cost": "an ending here goes all the way down for whoever it takes — no drift, no quiet resumption in a bad month, because the one who was in it has stopped existing. the five who were spared pay for it. they keep the whole arrangement running at its old warmth, and not one of the five is free to mourn a member of a household that answers to one name."
