    "moon": "each of you makes, and each makes consistently, since that is what a hand acquires. so the work arrives as six coherent bodies, interleaved, under a single name, in no order anybody could follow. nothing in here keeps a note of what left on which day. a finished object is the one proof that a particular one of you was ever at the bench, and it says nothing about which.",
