    "sun": "somebody who has done the years finally counts you properly and expects the count to explain things — this one wants the house, that one wants the road, and the argument you have with yourself gets a shape at last. what they find is six complete people who each want both. resolution was the relief on offer here, and it multiplies instead. twelve positions where a tidy six was expected.",
